: "with high numbers.", "bbox": {"x": 63.78571351357143, "y": 671.6666664315834, "width": 177.92857142857144, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A cant term.", "bbox": {"x": 261.85714260170806, "y": 675.0249999634964, "width": 117.50000000000001, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Make two stiffe long rowles or tampins of linnen", "bbox": {"x": 530.1636371571088, "y": 666.5307761903867, "width": 386.5751588003976, "height": 25.482669218381414}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALLOW-CAKE.", "bbox": {"x": 39.79533500156094, "y": 689.154960887757, "width": 172.22695841108052, "height": 27.746162748336864}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A cake of tallow; tallow", "bbox": {"x": 221.57142839291384, "y": 695.174999984008, "width": 251.78571428571425, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "clowtes, or such like stuffe, sharpe pointed like su-", "bbox": {"x": 510.0767777494517, "y": 686.0313686846099, "width": 406.6226332528251, "height": 25.623783459266264}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "made up in the form of a cake.", "bbox": {"x": 63.785714120125526, "y": 718.6833333219876, "width": 278.6428571428571, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Var. dial.", "bbox": {"x": 359.1125756164312, "y": 714.8745544910346, "width": 87.48913247244695, "height": 21.05089049339298}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ger-loves; which tampins are called of the physi-", "bbox": {"x": 510.2857140541139, "y": 708.6083333205803, "width": 406.2142857142857, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALLOW-CATCH.", "bbox": {"x": 43.106576125378304, "y": 731.5909219902778, "width": 182.6264250619071, "height": 27.928886397679634}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tians in Latine peasi, and being annointed with the", "bbox": {"x": 510.285714055618, "y": 728.7583333238998, "width": 409.5714285714287, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Same as Keech (2).", "bbox": {"x": 234.99999982864583, "y": 738.8333333088456, "width": 184.64285714285717, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALLOW-CRAPS.", "bbox": {"x": 40.28571143214293, "y": 755.6249996081945, "width": 184.64285714285714, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "See Craps (1).", "bbox": {"x": 227.53121757688814, "y": 756.0958580747529, "width": 145.85921532767156, "height": 29.43562307357781}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ointment aforesaid, thrust them up into the horsses nostrils, and let them abide therain a pretty whilk;", "bbox": {"x": 506.69984945030717, "y": 746.3153958250394, "width": 413.4968079158238, "height": 41.363009210427734}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALLOW-HUED.", "bbox": {"x": 39.92257094932652, "y": 777.1646545110938, "width": 175.40555327279228, "height": 25.84187594652165}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Pale as tallow.", "bbox": {"x": 234.9999997889796, "y": 782.491666637881, "width": 154.42857142857142, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Burton uses the phrase tallow-faced.", "bbox": {"x": 63.785714116071446, "y": 802.6416666541622, "width": 318.92857142857144, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "North.", "bbox": {"x": 399.4999998636161, "y": 782.4916666036979, "width": 70.49999999999997, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "then pul them out, and you shal see such abundance", "bbox": {"x": 506.772906755816, "y": 782.8830262863858, "width": 413.258056640625, "height": 24.522143403689007}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALLOW-LAFE.", "bbox": {"x": 40.285714114126975, "y": 822.7916666405463, "width": 161.14285714285717, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "matter", "bbox": {"x": 540.4999998426339, "y": 805.999999947526, "width": 63.785714285714356, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "come forth at his nose as is mar-", "bbox": {"x": 610.7910528673925, "y": 800.3350162014726, "width": 305.98508398873463, "height": 27.178153928121063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1500.", "bbox": {"x": 57.07142838258928, "y": 846.2999999160417, "width": 60.42857142857143, "height": 26.86666666666675}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Congiarium, MS. Dict. c.", "bbox": {"x": 221.5714283825893, "y": 826.1499999842578, "width": 248.42857142857142, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "vellous to behold.", "bbox": {"x": 509.85337547389173, "y": 821.906367099648, "width": 145.1841087341309, "height": 23.203559048970636}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Topself's Four-Footed Beasts, 1007, p. 372.", "bbox": {"x": 597.3410894092394, "y": 842.0916364436234, "width": 319.3373287745885, "height": 25.745034205913758}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALL-WOOD. \" Tall woode, pacte wodde to", "bbox": {"x": 40.02806551572474, "y": 864.0392836632219, "width": 433.54701014927457, "height": 28.070922231674086}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TAMPING-IRON.", "bbox": {"x": 486.14602299875935, "y": 856.513896586151, "width": 172.62755802699502, "height": 29.823191809654272}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A tool' used for beating", "bbox": {"x": 674.3422694465858, "y": 858.3234596413664, "width": 239.73099681309293, "height": 32.07849589188896}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "make byllettes of, taillee,\" Palsgrave. term is still used in Kent.", "bbox": {"x": 60.09474141566146, "y": 883.0484733879307, "width": 353.17027854919434, "height": 49.764938990275006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The", "bbox": {"x": 433.0714283883117, "y": 893.316666590341, "width": 40.28571428571428, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "down the earthy substance in the charge used", "bbox": {"x": 506.78077655809415, "y": 883.2806918586444, "width": 406.53805923461914, "height": 24.308349816004412}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALLY. (1) A term in playing ball, when the", "bbox": {"x": 40.076310490471585, "y": 929.5343787317809, "width": 433.44378989083424, "height": 29.696964780489722}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TAMPION.", "bbox": {"x": 486.7560670912593, "y": 926.7355720626772, "width": 110.84500830514088, "height": 20.47885580857583}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "number of aces on both sides is equal. North.", "bbox": {"x": 60.26515311201133, "y": 953.2920715753824, "width": 409.8928969247, "height": 28.386089460055047}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "for blasting A piece of wood fitted to the", "bbox": {"x": 501.3354363936447, "y": 900.163909031063, "width": 416.5917124067034, "height": 70.82284351984657}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "mouth of a large gun.", "bbox": {"x": 506.39971627021504, "y": 946.0655038036612, "width": 202.4632968902588, "height": 29.456722831726147}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "\"Tampyon for a gon,", "bbox": {"x": 717.7663435879704, "y": 949.0465974857947, "width": 199.38208253043035, "height": 29.962774332364354}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2) To reckon.", "bbox": {"x": 46.99999978418367, "y": 977.2749999640179, "width": 127.57142857142857, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "See Becon's Works, p. 134.", "bbox": {"x": 184.64285696998937, "y": 977.2749999824564, "width": 251.78571428571433, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tampon,\" Palsgrave, subst. f. 69.", "bbox": {"x": 506.62837087000077, "y": 969.1043931931521, "width": 302.7749595642089, "height": 27.87202146053307}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "3) In counting any articles which are sold by", "bbox": {"x": 46.99999982330823, "y": 997.4249999882164, "width": 423, "height": 26.86666666666657}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Unadvisedly gave fire to a peece charged with a", "bbox": {"x": 526.7974030255746, "y": 990.4069691947086, "width": 390.0049656459263, "height": 25.89663347005837}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "the hundred, bne is thrown out after each", "bbox": {"x": 60.42857122714284, "y": 1020.9333333232585, "width": 409.5714285714286, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "pellet insteede of a tampion, the which lighting on", "bbox": {"x": 506.804548507582, "y": 1008.5580268468425, "width": 409.8681291852678, "height": 26.212561353047676}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "hundred; that is called the tally.", "bbox": {"x": 60.42857097077921, "y": 1041.0833332977147, "width": 302.14285714285717, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "the palaice wall, ranne through one of the privie", "bbox": {"x": 506.76563027115714, "y": 1030.3831427175776, "width": 409.89860861642006, "height": 24.627028065919912}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The nam-", "bbox": {"x": 378.8627412614424, "y": 1045.4210273269637, "width": 91.3998035703386, "height": 19.239595719178435}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "lodgings, and did no further harme.", "bbox": {"x": 506.9285710802679, "y": 1051.1583333123438, "width": 285.35714285714295, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ber of tallies of course shows the number of", "bbox": {"x": 60.42857125934961, "y": 1064.5916666584756, "width": 416.28571428571433, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Lambardes Perambulation, 1596, p. 433.", "bbox": {"x": 614.127665470435, "y": 1069.6021604766963, "width": 302.5989216395786, "height": 23.73306033015251}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "hundreds.", "bbox": {"x": 60.28603176249533, "y": 1084.0282238164848, "width": 97.64222158704484, "height": 21.576885557174755}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "They are given in to the pur-", "bbox": {"x": 157.4803669951996, "y": 1082.6020571769614, "width": 312.8523047310966, "height": 29.860295740763323}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TAN. (1) Taken.", "bbox": {"x": 483.4285711767857, "y": 1088.0999999632684, "width": 167.85714285714283, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（4-5.", "bbox": {"x": 651.285714134643, "y": 1091.4583332829582, "width": 73.85714285714283, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "chaser.", "bbox": {"x": 63.78571409810924, "y": 1108.2499999506128, "width": 63.785714285714285, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hunter.", "bbox": {"x": 144.09588262557108, "y": 1107.289178034352, "width": 74.71538216727119, "height": 19.72081144650783}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "When pese was cryed and day tan,", "bbox": {"x": 543.8571426314988, "y": 1111.608333316817, "width": 275.2857142857143, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(4) A kind of small ship.", "bbox": {"x": 40.28571410702769, "y": 1128.399999981042, "width": 228.2857142857143, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Kyng Ardus was a yoyfulle mann", "bbox": {"x": 543.5023427228865, "y": 1128.172381050493, "width": 265.83808953421453, "height": 25.669744612773282}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(5) A company or division of voters at an elec-", "bbox": {"x": 40.28572563743608, "y": 1148.5499996081944, "width": 429.71426010131836, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantab. Pf. li. 38, f. 78.", "bbox": {"x": 698.0238505368976, "y": 1148.2296851877043, "width": 218.78891263689306, "height": 24.860358466704568}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tion.", "bbox": {"x": 60.428570883035725, "y": 1172.0583331234373, "width": 50.35714285714285, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Somerset.", "bbox": {"x": 120.52805836588185, "y": 1173.163932014828, "width": 91.36801147460939, "height": 19.957152438163902}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Baptem the first is holden than,", "bbox": {"x": 563.5340698616893, "y": 1168.050081659747, "width": 256.08246885027205, "height": 27.88685662746444}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(6) Stoutly; boldly.", "bbox": {"x": 43.64285696129738, "y": 1195.5666666461052, "width": 177.92857142857147, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "That falleth at the fonte be tan.", "bbox": {"x": 563.7426195214232, "y": 1190.1938082787765, "width": 252.27266802106584, "height": 22.6286202649277}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(7) Seemly; decently; elegantly.", "bbox": {"x": 43.37947990275527, "y": 1212.591869640255, "width": 296.06308146885465, "height": 26.86467134952545}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Sloan. 1785, f.34.", "bbox": {"x": 744.9167151576099, "y": 1211.6410000442465, "width": 175.25807380676278, "height": 23.742372343937497}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALME.", "bbox": {"x": 40.164704901363216, "y": 1232.0863362654677, "width": 80.81344549996511, "height": 24.352326862017396}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "To become dumb?", "bbox": {"x": 137.6428550446429, "y": 1235.8666664147918, "width": 174.57142857142856, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hur fadur nere-hande can talme, Soche a sweme hys harte can swalme.", "bbox": {"x": 100.43648710865972, "y": 1257.4770114684065, "width": 296.08003725324363, "height": 42.39289551575974}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Le Bone Florence of Rome, 769.", "bbox": {"x": 231.6428569726021, "y": 1299.674999985607, "width": 238.35714285714286, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "I donke upon David. til mi tonge talmes :", "bbox": {"x": 63.60714279230274, "y": 1314.7519665979191, "width": 329.37384687151234, "height": 22.007591416438302}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "I ne rendrede nowt. sithen men beren palmes :", "bbox": {"x": 63.37770262624093, "y": 1333.0506901771023, "width": 363.24479348318914, "height": 27.486742695172687}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Is it also mikel sorwe, in song so is in salmes?", "bbox": {"x": 60.216081539135544, "y": 1353.072533777055, "width": 369.63248825073254, "height": 25.287401974201202}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Reliq. Antiq. 1. 292.", "bbox": {"x": 318.9285712607143, "y": 1376.9166666471415, "width": 151.07142857142858, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "list", "text": "Then. Var, dial. To dun. To beat. Var. dial. A twig, or small switch.", "bbox": {"x": 486.7463375945041, "y": 1389.9628683860979, "width": 345.9098219190325, "height": 64.87151709397637}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALSHIDES. \"One pound of white lights, ten talshides, eight faggotts,\"", "bbox": {"x": 43.17062382230121, "y": 1390.1790019231998, "width": 430.43441990443637, "height": 53.13858790397641}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TALT.", "bbox": {"x": 43.642856919047624, "y": 1457.5166665967013, "width": 60.42857142857142, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "p. 162• pitched.", "bbox": {"x": 60.48075504930564, "y": 1423.7506280368773, "width": 141.67838505336215, "height": 67.91489458084106}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ord. and Reg.", "bbox": {"x": 321.72975412895954, "y": 1412.9085872415108, "width": 148.9545040130615, "height": 28.530860447883533}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "There was talt many pavyloun Of riche sendel and siclatoun.", "bbox": {"x": 120.23460291460681, "y": 1478.290333497904, "width": 246.0483199528285, "height": 42.52538553476341}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Kyng Alisounder, 5234", "bbox": {"x": 292.0714284003434, "y": 1521.3249999806249, "width": 177.92857142857142, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(2) To entice. (4.-S.)", "bbox": {"x": 486.78571405817456, "y": 1232.508333307213, "width": 211.50000000000003, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The fende of helle agayn skylle", "bbox": {"x": 563.9999998298434, "y": 1256.0166666528653, "width": 248.42857142857147, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Put in hir a harde wille", "bbox": {"x": 563.9999998291454, "y": 1276.1666666516742, "width": 191.35714285714286, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hur fadur luf to wynne;", "bbox": {"x": 580.4583768608408, "y": 1290.5863343374278, "width": 202.18503761291512, "height": 24.07737424174935}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "And also temped was that man His owne douzter for to tan, To do a dedly synne.", "bbox": {"x": 563.2969060811814, "y": 1310.9055811395672, "width": 246.08985137939462, "height": 61.728264856338356}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. v. 48, f. 43.", "bbox": {"x": 697.959309423412, "y": 1369.878443880269, "width": 218.8534573146275, "height": 24.861599534749985}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TANACLES.", "bbox": {"x": 486.785714107684, "y": 1454.158333302803, "width": 124.21428571428574, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A kind of pincers, used formerly", "bbox": {"x": 610.7304047888557, "y": 1453.1228651184322, "width": 306.11463437761574, "height": 28.14518774350476}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "for torturing.", "bbox": {"x": 506.5006942956965, "y": 1478.2099205391337, "width": 131.70817892892012, "height": 20.73919505278274}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "«To pinch or tanacle with", "bbox": {"x": 654.024222205714, "y": 1473.8422563712702, "width": 262.93911143711637, "height": 30.0333935062091}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tongs, with pincers or tanacles,\"", "bbox": {"x": 506.92857225386894, "y": 1497.8166664693645, "width": 335.7142857142858, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Florio,", "bbox": {"x": 851.5554716876751, "y": 1499.5214033369402, "width": 69.75018678392681, "height": 26.116582755247798}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "p. 552, ed. 1611.", "bbox": {"x": 506.92857129084246, "y": 1521.3249999741668, "width": 154.4285714285714, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "11.", "bbox": {"x": 87.28571411785714, "y": 1541.4749998800596, "width": 23.50000000000001, "height": 16.791666666666785}}], "ms": 352.748875}